  "title": "geometry_overlay と facility_queues の規則を Rust へ移す（M6）",
  "user": {
    "login": "WaTeR-7",
    "id": 128142265,
    "node_id": "U_kgDOB6NLuQ",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128142265?v=4",
